20	/**
21	 * Shared helpers for the NxLabs pages of the new marketing site (/mods,
22	 * /mods/games/[family], /mods/games/[family]/all, /mods/[family]/[slug]).
23	 *
24	 * Every mod, count, category, game and price comes from the system at request
25	 * time: lib/mods-catalog.ts over db.gameMod (public = active && upstreamOk),
26	 * lib/games.ts for names/art, db.gamePlan (via lib.ts gameTiers) for prices.
27	 * The markup renderers below are ports of the design package's own card
28	 * builders (source/mods_ui.py card(), the hub's npk cards, mod_tags.py
29	 * tiles()/sides()) so the approved look is kept while the data is real.
30	 */
31	
